{
  "title": "TB-3PO",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Generative 303-style",
        "acid sequencer.",
        "",
        "Two slots, A and B,",
        "run in parallel. Each",
        "has its own pattern,",
        "MIDI channel and set",
        "of banks.",
        "",
        "Load a resonant mono",
        "synth into a shadow",
        "slot (303, Bristol,",
        "OB-Xd, Moog) and set",
        "its receive channel to",
        "match the slot you",
        "want to drive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Slots & Modes",
      "lines": [
        "Track buttons 1-4:",
        "",
        "T1 Slot A, 3PO",
        "   sequencer knobs",
        "T2 Slot A, 303",
        "   live CC control",
        "T3 Slot B, 3PO",
        "T4 Slot B, 303",
        "",
        "BOTH SLOTS SEQUENCE",
        "AT ALL TIMES. The",
        "track buttons only",
        "choose which slot the",
        "8 knobs and the pads",
        "are editing.",
        "",
        "The active one lights",
        "bright: teal for 3PO,",
        "orange for 303.",
        "",
        "A 303-mode button",
        "stays dark unless a",
        "303 plugin is loaded."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs: 3PO",
      "lines": [
        "1 Density",
        "  chance of a note",
        "  rather than a rest",
        "2 Accent",
        "  chance a note is",
        "  accented (loud)",
        "3 Slide",
        "  chance a note",
        "  slides into the",
        "  next one",
        "4 Octaves",
        "  range, 1 to 3",
        "5 Root",
        "  key root, C to B",
        "6 Scale",
        "  Minor, Phrygian,",
        "  HarmMinor, MinPent,",
        "  Dorian, Major",
        "7 Length",
        "  8, 16, 24 or 32",
        "  steps",
        "8 Gate",
        "  note length as a",
        "  % of the step",
        "",
        "Knobs 1-4 mark the",
        "pattern stale. Press",
        "NEW (pad 1) to",
        "regenerate it, or MUT",
        "(pad 2) to nudge",
        "about a quarter of",
        "the steps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs: 303",
      "lines": [
        "A live CC controller",
        "for a 303 on this",
        "slot's MIDI channel.",
        "",
        "1 Cutoff    CC 74",
        "2 Resonance CC 71",
        "3 Decay     CC 75",
        "4 Env Mod   CC 70",
        "5 Accent    CC 16",
        "6 Volume    CC 7",
        "7 Drive     CC 12",
        "8 Drive Mix CC 13",
        "",
        "Entering 303 mode",
        "syncs the knobs to",
        "the plugin's current",
        "values, so the first",
        "turn does not jump."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Step buttons 1-5:",
        "",
        "1 PERFORM",
        "  pattern view and",
        "  step grid",
        "2 MUTATION",
        "  jog-edit Density,",
        "  Accent, Slide, Oct",
        "3 SCALE",
        "  jog-edit Root,",
        "  Scale, Length, Gate",
        "4 CHANNEL",
        "  jog-edit the MIDI",
        "  out channel, 1-16",
        "5 HELP",
        "  on-screen pad map",
        "",
        "In 303 mode, pages 2",
        "and 3 become 303",
        "Control 1 and 2, with",
        "live CC readouts for",
        "knobs 1-4 and 5-8."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "Four rows. The top",
        "row is row 3.",
        "",
        "Row 3 (top)",
        "  steps 1-8 of the",
        "  current step page",
        "Row 2",
        "  steps 9-16. Tap to",
        "  cycle a step:",
        "  rest, note, accent,",
        "  slide.",
        "Row 1",
        "  pattern banks 1-8.",
        "  Tap recalls (queued",
        "  to the next bar if",
        "  playing).",
        "  Shift+tap saves the",
        "  current pattern to",
        "  that bank.",
        "Row 0 (bottom)",
        "  1 NEW  regenerate",
        "    from a new seed",
        "  2 MUT  nudge about",
        "    25% of the steps",
        "  3 DIR  cycle Fwd,",
        "    Rev, Ping, Rnd",
        "  4 Ch-  channel down",
        "  5 Ch+  channel up"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Buttons",
      "lines": [
        "Plus / Minus",
        "  transpose by an",
        "  octave, clamped to",
        "  48 semitones",
        "Left / Right",
        "  step page, for 24",
        "  and 32-step",
        "  patterns",
        "Delete (X)",
        "  CLEAR. Gated - it",
        "  needs Shift+X.",
        "Undo",
        "  revert the last",
        "  NEW, MUT or CLEAR",
        "Play",
        "  transport. Passed",
        "  through to Move."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "LED Colours",
      "lines": [
        "Steps",
        "  white  note",
        "  red    accent",
        "  blue   slide",
        "  off    rest",
        "  The current step",
        "  blinks yellow.",
        "",
        "Banks",
        "  purple current",
        "  teal   filled",
        "  off    empty",
        "  A yellow flash",
        "  means queued for",
        "  the next bar.",
        "  With Shift held",
        "  the row pulses",
        "  red and pink to",
        "  show save targets.",
        "",
        "Actions",
        "  teal NEW, indigo",
        "  MUT, orange DIR",
        "",
        "Pages",
        "  green is the",
        "  current step page,",
        "  white is available"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Suspend & Exit",
      "lines": [
        "Back",
        "  hide TB-3PO and",
        "  keep BOTH slots",
        "  sequencing in the",
        "  background.",
        "Shift+Back",
        "  fully exit, release",
        "  notes and unload.",
        "Shift+Vol+Back",
        "  also suspends.",
        "Shift+Vol+Jog Click",
        "  also fully exits.",
        "",
        "Re-open it from Tools",
        "and both slots resume",
        "with their patterns",
        "and positions intact."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sync",
      "lines": [
        "Tempo follows Move's",
        "project BPM by",
        "itself.",
        "",
        "TB-3PO runs free - it",
        "is not gated by",
        "Move's transport, so",
        "use the Play button",
        "to start and stop it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credits",
      "lines": [
        "Algorithm: djphazer /",
        "Hemisphere Suite,",
        "the TB_3PO applet.",
        "",
        "Schwung port:",
        " Charles Vestal",
        " (GPL-3.0)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
